abstract: "A public v3.4 contact-angle dataset and locked reproducibility package for leakage-aware evaluation of physics-constrained residual learning with apparent surface-energy descriptors. The release includes curated contact-angle records, fixed split manifests, LOO-SFE corrected result tables, paired statistical comparisons, and figure-generation inputs."
keywords:
  - contact angle
  - wettability
  - surface energy
  - physics-constrained learning
  - residual learning
  - leakage-aware validation
  - leave-one-liquid-out SFE

